    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stacta</span></b> , ae, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stactē</span></b> , ēs,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στακτή</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>myrrh-oil.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> Stacta, <i><span class="en">Lucr. 2,
			847</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plaut. Truc. 2, 5, 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Most.
				1, 3, 151</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 12, 15, 35, §
			70</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			Stacte, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Curc. 1, 2, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 13, 1,
				2, § 17</span></i>.—Also, myrrha stacta (stacte),
				<i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 125</span></i>; <i><span class="en">145</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 12,
				15, 35, § 68</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>, Col. poët. 10, 173.</div>
